    <string name="about_eyebrow">How to use OISINT</string>
    <string name="about_title">From \"Where should we go?\"\nto \"This place.\"</string>
    <string name="process_step1_title">Start from the situation</string>
    <string name="process_step1_text">Headcount, budget, vibe. Even conditions that are hard to put into words, as they are.</string>
    <string name="process_step2_title">Check what\'s behind each candidate</string>
    <string name="process_step2_text">Line up public information and sources, so \"looks good\" isn\'t the end of it.</string>
    <string name="process_step3_title">Get to \"This one\" together</string>
    <string name="process_step3_text">Add conditions on the shared screen, and make the final call yourselves.</string>
    <string name="process_guide_title">Candidates take shape\nas you talk.</string>
    <string name="process_guide_body">It doesn\'t stop at a list. Each time someone adds a condition, a new \"How about this one?\" comes into view.</string>
    <string name="process_guide_badge">Decide properly, with the reasons in view</string>
